":"<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Method</span></span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jvmk81e7":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Cook the bacon ahead of time and store it in the refrigerator in an airtight container for easy sandwich topping.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Prepare the buns with a light touch of real butter and <a href=\"https://www.theglasspantry.com/my-secret-spice-blend\" target=\"_self\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#3D9BE9;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">My&nbsp;Secret Spice Blend.</span></span></span></a>&nbsp;(click the link for the easy recipe)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Start pre-heating your grill to 400 degrees then add the garlic,&nbsp;onion powder and oil (if using) to&nbsp;the beef and mix well. Divide the beef into&nbsp;quarters for 1/4 pound&nbsp;burgers.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Place a sheet of plastic wrap on a flat surface then top with a nice round 1/4 pound ball of the ground beef mixture.&nbsp;Cover that with another sheet of plastic, then use the back of a large metal turner for smashing the burger. You want it to be evenly smashed for even grilling. Your burger should have lots of rough edges.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Move the burger to a plate leaving the plastic wrap intact and repeat the procedure&nbsp;with the rest of the burger making four equal size patties. It&#39;s okay to stack these up.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">At the grill, peel the plastic from one side of one burger while holding it in one hand then flip the burger onto your other hand and remove the other side of the plastic before placing the burger on the hot grill. Grill with the lid open until the burgers begin to sear and char a little on the edges then turn them over. ( About 5 minutes )</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Meanwhile, place the bacon you want to use on a large sheet of aluminum foil. Fold and seal the edges to form a packet&nbsp;then&nbsp;place the packet of bacon on the grill with the burgers. </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">After turning them, season the burgers with salt and pepper.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Meanwhile, add the buns cut side down to a cast iron pan that you have pre-heated to medium.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">While the buns are toasting, add some cheese to the burgers. You pick the cheese, we used some provolone here.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Remove the burgers when the edges are crispy and caramelized and the cheese is just melted. About 8-10 minutes total.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Toast the buns to a nice golden color with crispy edges, then remove them from the griddle pan. (4-5 minutes)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Remove the Bacon from the grill and open the packet.&nbsp;Top the burgers with the bacon, fresh lettuce, tomato, red onion and your favorite condiments.</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">&nbsp;</p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jvmk81fb":{"id":"comp-jvmk81fb","appDefinitionId":"13016589-a9eb-424a-8a69-46cb05ce0b2c","widgetId":"130165ba-4eeb-4a87-3121-a3cf2a86d2ca","isAppInClientSpecMap":true,"isViewerMode":true,"isResponsive":false,"translations":{"preloaderOverlay":{"loading":"Loading"},"errorMessageOverlay":{"reloadText":"Refresh this page","oopsText":"App Didn't Load","installErrorText":"We Were Unable to Install This App","generalErrorPrefix":"Try again later, disable any ad blockers, or reload the page. Contact the author of","generalErrorSuffix":"for help.","uninstalledErrorText":"We Were Unable to Install This App"},"unavailableMessageOverlay":{"title":"Widget Didn’t Load","text1":"Check your internet and refresh this page.","text2":"If that doesn’t work, contact us.","reloadText":"Refresh this page"}},"applicationId":"2979"},"comp-jvmk81gf":{"images":[{"quality":{},"link":{},"data-anchor":{},"uri":"b25591_24a35ec53c4a4d41a0da9c7b7cd6d2d3~mv2_d_3000_1965_s_2.jpg","alt":"","width":3000,"height":1965,"id":"dataItem-jvmk81gq","title":"Add a Title","type":"Image"},{"quality":{},"link":{},"data-anchor":{},"uri":"b25591_f1ab68320b444a4ca3cc0b7dd2284bf5~mv2_d_3000_4500_s_4_2.jpg","alt":"","width":3000,"height":4500,"id":"dataItem-jvmk81gr","title":"Add a Title","type":"Image"},{"quality":{},"link":{},"data-anchor":{},"uri":"b25591_2790fd3a23db403793dbf2c3c1c62723~mv2_d_3000_1946_s_2.jpg","alt":"","width":3000,"height":1946,"id":"dataItem-jvmk81gr1","title":"Add a Title","type":"Image"},{"quality":{},"link":{},"data-anchor":{},"uri":"b25591_bc3841f1dee44abf840a9a1b33591002~mv2_d_3000_1995_s_2.jpg","alt":"","width":3000,"height":1995,"id":"dataItem-jvmk81gs","title":"Add a Title","type":"Image"},{"quality":{},"link":{},"data-anchor":{},"uri